    TG -- "/social &lt;idea&gt;" --> ROUTER
    TG -- "/cron list" --> ROUTER
    TG -- "/digest" --> ROUTER
    TG -- "/heartbeat" --> ROUTER
    SOC_GEN -- writes post --> NOTION_SOCIAL
    ROUTER -- replies with generated content --> TG
    ROUTER -- sends cron jobs list --> TG
    ROUTER -- sends health summary --> TG
